{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "70316433-42e1-4aac-ae81-plesticketapi",
    "name": "PlesTicket API",
    "description": "PlesTicket API - folders map to the frontend that calls them.\n\n  Public                 no auth; buyer site pre-login + shared reference data\n  Platform Auth          shared login for Buyer and EO (one users table)\n  Buyer App              orders, payments, tickets\n  EO App                 organizer dashboard; needs is_organizer = true\n  Organizer Member Apps  gate scanner + agent portal (separate auth guard)\n  Super Admin Console    platform administration\n  Webhooks               provider callbacks\n\nTOKENS: {{platform_token}} is set by any Platform Auth login and is used by Buyer, EO and Super Admin folders - logging in as a different account overwrites it. {{organizer_token}} is separate and set by Organizer Login.\n\nEO ROUTES: return 403 EO_NOT_ACTIVATED unless the account has is_organizer = true. organizer.demo@plesticket.com is seeded with it; a freshly registered account is not - run 'Activate Organizer Access'.\n\nORDER EXPIRY: unpaid orders are swept ~every 5 minutes past their 30-minute hold, releasing their quota. An order_number from an earlier session may have expired - create a new order rather than reusing a stale one.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
