      "description": "The organizer dashboard. Every request here sits behind the `eo` middleware and needs is_organizer = true. A plain buyer account gets 403 with errors.code = EO_NOT_ACTIVATED - that is a signal to onboard, not to log out.\n\nLog in as organizer.demo@plesticket.com (already activated) or run Activate Organizer Access first."
    },
